Subject: [PATCH] Skip LevelTicks container scan when nothing due (Gale #204)

Port of GaleMC/Gale #204 LevelTicks part against our tree.
Tracks nextTickScan so sortContainersToTick can return early
instead of iterating the whole map every tick.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/ticks/LevelTicks.java b/net/minecraft/world/ticks/LevelTicks.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/ticks/LevelTicks.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/ticks/LevelTicks.java
